        "name": "avg_npc_067.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_067",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Armed Infected A\"]  Which one?! Hey, Gendarmerie! Don't do anything stupid. We got hostages!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Armed Infected A",
        "content": "Which one?! Hey, Gendarmerie! Don't do anything stupid. We got hostages!"
