        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Tatjana\"]  Everything here is made of wood. This whole block will go up in flames!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Tatjana",
        "content": "Everything here is made of wood. This whole block will go up in flames!"
