    {
        "id": 131,
        "raw": "[PlaySound(key=\"$rungeneral\", volume=0.6)]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "audio/sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_rungeneral.mp3",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "id": 132,
        "raw": "[delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 133,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 134,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  If only Miss Folinic was here...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "If only Miss Folinic was here..."
    },
    {
        "id": 135,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\", name2=\"avg_npc_066\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 136,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  Wait... she isn't back yet?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "Wait... she isn't back yet?"
    },
    {
        "id": 137,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_066\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 138,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  Oi! Where are Folinic and Tatjana?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "Oi! Where are Folinic and Tatjana?"
    },
    {
        "id": 139,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_068\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 140,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  They, I think they're still at Zwölftontechnik Strasse...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "They, I think they're still at Zwölftontechnik Strasse..."
    },
    {
        "id": 141,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_066\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 142,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  Did I not just ask if they all routed?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "Did I not just ask if they all routed?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 143,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_068\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 144,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  Er! S- sorry, sir! But Folinic and Tatjana should be alright. They've saved many lives!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "Er! S- sorry, sir! But Folinic and Tatjana should be alright. They've saved many lives!"
    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_066\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  What do you mean they'll be alright? The insurgents have control of our town's defenses, we have no regular troops, and——*cough* *cough* *cough*!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "What do you mean they'll be alright? The insurgents have control of our town's defenses, we have no regular troops, and——*cough* *cough* *cough*!"
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  ——*cough*, get some heavies and come with me.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "——*cough*, get some heavies and come with me."
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_068\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  But they have firepower, and maybe hostages. We shouldn't provoke them any more. Let's wait for a chance to parley.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "But they have firepower, and maybe hostages. We shouldn't provoke them any more. Let's wait for a chance to parley."
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_066\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  A chance? You're going to wait for the enemy to give you a chance? Have you ever fought a battle?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "A chance? You're going to wait for the enemy to give you a chance? Have you ever fought a battle?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 152,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_068\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 153,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  S-sorry!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "S-sorry!"
    },
    {
        "id": 154,
        "raw": "[Dialog]",
        "type": "dialog_marker"
    },
    {
        "id": 155,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 156,
        "raw": "[PlaySound(key=\"$d_gen_walk_n\", volume=0.6)]",
        "type": "play_sound",
        "key": "audio/sound_beta_2/avg/d_gen_walk_n.mp3",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "id": 157,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1#2\",fadetime=1,block=true)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1#2.png",
        "fadetime": "1,block=true"
    },
    {
        "id": 158,
        "raw": "[delay(time=1)]",
        "type": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 159,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  But his concerns are reasonable. The active Originium left behind by the Great Rift are likely still in the foundation of Wolumonde. The consequences of letting them destroy it would be unthinkable.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "But his concerns are reasonable. The active Originium left behind by the Great Rift are likely still in the foundation of Wolumonde. The consequences of letting them destroy it would be unthinkable."
    },
    {
        "id": 160,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_068\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 161,
        "raw": "[name=\"Townsfolk\"]  Where did you come from? You shouldn't be here!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Townsfolk",
        "content": "Where did you come from? You shouldn't be here!"
    },
    {
        "id": 162,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_066#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 163,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  No.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "No."
    },
    {
        "id": 164,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  With no Gendarmerie, we're the ones who shouldn't be here... I've seen you before, Rhodes Island Operators.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "With no Gendarmerie, we're the ones who shouldn't be here... I've seen you before, Rhodes Island Operators."
    },
    {
        "id": 165,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 166,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Thank you for understanding. Ayerscarpe?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Thank you for understanding. Ayerscarpe?"
    },
    {
        "id": 167,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_294_ayer\", name2=\"char_367_swllow_1\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer.png",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 168,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ayerscarpe\"]  A quick, on-the-spot assessment: if they continue to bombard the area with that device, we have ten to thirty minutes before Wolumonde comes to a halt.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ayerscarpe",
        "content": "A quick, on-the-spot assessment: if they continue to bombard the area with that device, we have ten to thirty minutes before Wolumonde comes to a halt."
    },
    {
        "id": 169,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ayerscarpe\"]  The best way to handle this would be to sever the link between this district and the rest of the city, but Wolumonde is no nomadic city. Individual districts do not have the power to move autonomously.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ayerscarpe",
        "content": "The best way to handle this would be to sever the link between this district and the rest of the city, but Wolumonde is no nomadic city. Individual districts do not have the power to move autonomously."
    },
    {
        "id": 170,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_066\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 171,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  Actually, a tractor could do it... But not when the streets are full of rebels.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "Actually, a tractor could do it... But not when the streets are full of rebels."
    },
    {
        "id": 172,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_066\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 173,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Is there an application procedure for an armed intervention?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Is there an application procedure for an armed intervention?"
    },
    {
        "id": 174,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"avg_npc_066\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 175,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  ...Go nuts.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "...Go nuts."
    },
    {
        "id": 176,
        "raw": "[name=\"Severin\"]  And please... Be sure to save Tatjana and Folinic.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Severin",
        "content": "And please... Be sure to save Tatjana and Folinic."
    },
    {
        "id": 177,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 178,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Mr. Severin, we need— Ah!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Mr. Severin, we need— Ah!"
    },
    {
        "id": 179,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 180,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  ...Lisa?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "...Lisa?"
    },
    {
        "id": 181,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 182,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Is... is that Operator GreyThroat? And who's this?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Is... is that Operator GreyThroat? And who's this?"
    },
    {
        "id": 183,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_294_ayer\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer.png"
    },
    {
        "id": 184,
        "raw": "[name=\"Ayerscarpe\"]  Operator Ayerscarpe, bodyguard of Catastrophe Messenger Leonhardt. He is out on another mission, so I got dragged over here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Ayerscarpe",
        "content": "Operator Ayerscarpe, bodyguard of Catastrophe Messenger Leonhardt. He is out on another mission, so I got dragged over here."
    },
    {
        "id": 185,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#3\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 186,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Lisa, where are Atro and Folinic?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Lisa, where are Atro and Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "id": 187,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#4\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 188,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Miss Folinic is still in there! But Miss Atro... she's... um...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Miss Folinic is still in there! But Miss Atro... she's... um..."
    },
    {
        "id": 189,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#4\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 190,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  It's okay. I understand. I just had to be sure... We'll talk about it later.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "It's okay. I understand. I just had to be sure... We'll talk about it later."
    },
    {
        "id": 191,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 192,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  Mmm... It's, it's nice to have some senior operators coming to help...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "Mmm... It's, it's nice to have some senior operators coming to help..."
    },
    {
        "id": 193,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#2\",focus=2)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "id": 194,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  B-but I still need to stay focused!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "B-but I still need to stay focused!"
    },
    {
        "id": 195,
        "raw": "[name=\"Suzuran\"]  I'll take care of the wounded. Whatever you do, please bring Miss Folinic back safely!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Suzuran",
        "content": "I'll take care of the wounded. Whatever you do, please bring Miss Folinic back safely!"
    },
    {
        "id": 196,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_367_swllow_1\", name2=\"char_358_lisa_1#2\",focus=1)]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1.png",
        "name2": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "id": 197,
        "raw": "[name=\"GreyThroat\"]  Right. I will.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "GreyThroat",
        "content": "Right. I will."
    },
